  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THEWILDFIRE-THE_WILDFIRE.4-0r.ancient": "なぜ私の周りには、これほどしつこい虫がたかるのだ？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THEWILDFIRE-THE_WILDFIRE.4-0r.next": "キレる",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THEWILDFIRE-THE_WILDFIRE.4-1r.char": "[jitter][b]あんたが人を殺し続けてるからでしょ、このイカれ野郎！！[/b][/jitter]",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THEWILDFIRE-THE_WILDFIRE.4-1r.next": "続ける",
